av1_dec->tile_info.size = AV1_TILE_INFO_SIZE;
Reason:
AV1_TILE_INFO_SIZE is the correct total size (AV1_MAX_TILES * 16 bytes). This ensures the buffer is large enough to hold all tile info structures, preventing the buffer overflow.


